# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HegoSentinel — repository hygiene (Sprint 9)
# Rule of thumb: nothing secret, generated, huge, or customer-owned is committed.
# Templates (.env.example) and synthetic fixtures (examples/**) stay tracked.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Dependencies & local toolchains (several GB: Semgrep venv, Trivy binary/cache, uv cache)
node_modules/
.tools/
.venv/
apps/api/vendor/
.next/
apps/web/.next/
apps/web/out/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Nested duplicate copies and archives are read-only history, never a source of truth
/HegoSentinel/
*.zip
*.tar
*.tgz
*.7z
*.rar
*.bundle

# Secrets and local configuration (only the *.example template is tracked)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
secrets/
credentials*.json
service-account*.json

# Customer data and real scan output must never be committed
reports/
customer-reports/
client-data/

# Local databases, caches and scratch files
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal
apps/api/database/*.sqlite*
coverage/
.cache/
tmp/
*.tmp
.tmp-*
.playwright-mcp/

# Generated logs (curated audit evidence logs are the explicit exception)
*.log
!docs/audit-evidence/**/*.log

# Local-only forensic artefacts of the version audit (contain local paths / private archive names)
docs/audit-evidence/tools/
docs/audit-evidence/zip_*.json
docs/audit-evidence/zip_table.md
docs/audit-evidence/zip08_truncated_header_scan.json
docs/audit-evidence/canonical_manifest_sha256.tsv

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
